Author: Shrabanti Chowdhury, Anna Xing, Pei Wang
Maintainer: Anna Xing <anna.xing@mssm.edu>
Description: Trains and evaluates pathway-guided ensemble models on bulk or
    cell-type-specific molecular data. Supports pathway and gene selection,
    optional literature priors, and prediction for binary, categorical,
    survival, and continuous outcomes.
URL: https://Shrabanti87.github.io/CASPEN/, https://github.com/Shrabanti87/CASPEN
